  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "comet-1.5k",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tComet-1.5k \u2014 RFT Dataset (Openpi-Comet)\n\t\n\nThis repository releases Comet-1.5k, an RFT (Rejection Sampling Fine-Tuning) dataset generated by Team Comet\u2019s post-training pipeline on the BEHAVIOR-1K simulator (OmniGibson).It is intended to support reproducible research on post-training for VLA policies, dataset construction via rejection sampling, and efficient iteration over high-signal rollouts.\n\nContext. Team Comet\u2019s BEHAVIOR-1K challenge submission achieved Q-score 0.2514 on Held-out\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/delinqu/comet-1.5k.",
